  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "The red rays contain all values less than $-2$ or greater than $1.$ In addition, \n\n- the open circle at $-2$ implies that $x$ cannot be equal to $-2,$ and\n\n- the open circle at $1$ implies that $x$ cannot be equal to $2.$\n\nTherefore, the highlighted region represents $x<-2$ or $x>1.$",
